      "source_xml_line": 338,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I, umm... ahem... I heard you guys got a pretty cool grenade launcher... All I wanna do is just take a look at it, see? Just get a quick glimpse of it... What do you say? Just a real quick look...",
      "JA_current": "んんん… ごほん… アンタらは Bulldog 6 を持ってる、と聞いた… それをただ、見てみたいんだが、どうだ？ ちょっと、ひと目見させてくれ… どうだ？ ホントに、ほんのちょっとでいいから…。",
      "JA_new": "あの……ええと、あんたたちがすごいグレネードランチャーを持ってるって聞いたんだ……ちょっと見せてもらいたいだけだ。な？少しだけ、ちらっと……どうだ？ほんの一瞬でいいから……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 341,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Whaat?... You, umm... go to... ah, hell, what was it... I forgot! What were you asking about?",
      "JA_current": "何いい…？ んん… ちく… あう、ちくしょう、何だっけ… 忘れちまった！ 今、何て聞いた？",
      "JA_new": "ええと……あんた……どこへ……ああ、くそ、何だっけ……忘れた！何の話だった？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 344,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Oh for fuck's sake... Gre-nade laun-cher... I'd like to... see it!",
      "JA_current": "かかか… 寛大なる… ご許可を… くそっ！ グレ、ネード、ラン、チャー… 俺は… それが見たい！",
      "JA_new": "もう、いい加減にしてくれ……グレネードランチャーだよ……見せてくれ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 347,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Nah... that you can't... anything you want, friend, but not that... No can do!",
      "JA_current": "だめだ… お前には、見せない… 望みの何も、友人でもだ… 誰にも見せない！",
      "JA_new": "いや……それは無理だ……何でも頼んでくれていいが、それだけは駄目だ……無理だ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 350,
      "string_id": "mil_cook_drunk_question_about_rg6_2_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Umm, ok... I, umm... didn't mean anything by it! Just asking...",
      "JA_current": "んーっと、よし… んん… 何でもなかった！ 聞いてみただけだよ…。",
      "JA_new": "あ、そうか……俺は……別に変な意味じゃないから！ちょっと聞いてみただけだ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
